.TH SDL_StopHapticEffect 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_StopHapticEffect \- Stop the haptic effect on its associated haptic device.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_haptic.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_StopHapticEffect(SDL_Haptic *haptic, SDL_HapticEffectID effect);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I haptic
the
.BR SDL_Haptic
device to stop the effect on\[char46]
.TP
.I effect
the ID of the haptic effect to stop\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

